        ('mth11b-01-mcq-0131', 1, 'In an examination with the grouped marks 0-10:5, 10-20:9, 20-30:16, 30-40:20, 40-50:12, 50-60:4, 60% of students pass. Estimate the minimum passing mark.', '27.294117647058822', '17.75', '36.5', '27.75', 'd', 3, 'The failed percentage gives the percentile at the pass cutoff; compute that percentile using grouped data.', 'If 60% pass, 40% fail, so the cutoff is P40. Its rank is 40N/100=26.4. It lies in 20-30; therefore cutoff=20+10/16(26.4−14)=27.75. The other options come from omitting c.f., changing f, or subtracting the class frequency.'),
        ('mth11b-01-mcq-0132', 1, 'In an examination with the grouped marks 0-10:6, 10-20:10, 20-30:17, 30-40:21, 40-50:13, 50-60:5, 58% of students pass. Estimate the minimum passing mark.', '27.91111111111111', '18.376470588235293', '37.78823529411765', '28.376470588235293', 'd', 3, 'The failed percentage gives the percentile at the pass cutoff; compute that percentile using grouped data.', 'If 58% pass, 42% fail, so the cutoff is P42. Its rank is 42N/100=30.24. It lies in 20-30; therefore cutoff=20+10/17(30.24−16)=28.38. The other options come from omitting c.f., changing f, or subtracting the class frequency.'),
        ('mth11b-01-mcq-0133', 1, 'In an examination with the grouped marks 0-10:7, 10-20:11, 20-30:18, 30-40:22, 40-50:14, 50-60:4, 56% of students pass. Estimate the minimum passing mark.', '38.577777777777776', '18.577777777777776', '28.126315789473683', '28.577777777777776', 'd', 3, 'The failed percentage gives the percentile at the pass cutoff; compute that percentile using grouped data.', 'If 56% pass, 44% fail, so the cutoff is P44. Its rank is 44N/100=33.44. It lies in 20-30; therefore cutoff=20+10/18(33.44−18)=28.58. The other options come from omitting c.f., changing f, or subtracting the class frequency.'),
