        ('mth11b-01-mcq-0151', 1, 'For classes 0-10, 10-20, 20-30, 30-40 and 40-50, the frequencies are 2, x, 10, 3, 2. If D2=14.3333, find x.', '4', '8', '6', '9.0', 'c', 3, 'Write N in terms of x and use D2=L+h/f(2N/10−c.f.).', 'Total N=17+x. Since D2 is in 10-20, D2=10+10/x[N/5−2]=14.33. Solving gives x=6. Option A (4) results from an algebraic shift such as using the wrong class-position factor or moving a term incorrectly. Option B (8) results from an algebraic shift such as using the wrong class-position factor or moving a term incorrectly. Option D (9.0) results from an algebraic shift such as using the wrong class-position factor or moving a term incorrectly.'),
