        ('mth11b-01-mcq-0185', 1, 'Which expression represents the second quartile?', 'Q4', 'Q3', 'Q1', 'Q2', 'd', 1, 'Recall the definition or formula directly, then substitute the given values if needed.', 's Option A uses a different definition, formula, or axis choice. Option B uses a different definition, formula, or axis choice. Option C uses a different definition, formula, or axis choice. Option A applies the wrong definition or formula. Option B applies the wrong definition or formula. Option C applies the wrong definition or formula.'),
