        ('mth11b-01-mcq-0188', 1, 'For n observations, which position formula gives Qi?', 'i(n−1)/4', '(i+1)n/4', 'i(n+1)/4', 'in/4', 'c', 1, 'Recall the definition or formula directly, then substitute the given values if needed.', '- Option A uses a different definition, formula, or axis choice. Option B uses a different definition, formula, or axis choice. Option D uses a different definition, formula, or axis choice. Option A applies the wrong definition or formula. Option B applies the wrong definition or formula. Option D applies the wrong definition or formula.'),
