        ('mth11b-06-mcq-0201', 6, 'Using the five digits 1, 2, 4, 7, 8, form all five-digit numbers without repetition. What is the sum of all these numbers?', '528', '586660', '5866608', '2640', 'c', 2, 'Each digit occurs equally often in each place; find its total contribution across all positions.', 'Each digit occurs 4! times in each position. Sum of digits = 22; contribution per place = 22×24. Thus total = 22×24×11111 = 5866608. Option A results from using combinations, which ignore order. Option B results from allowing repetition when it is forbidden. Option D results from using an incomplete permutation product.'),
