        ('mth11b-06-mcq-0211', 6, 'There are 2 distinct books in group A, 3 in group B, and 4 in group C. All books from each group must stay together on a shelf. How many arrangements are possible?', '288', '17280', '362880', '1728', 'd', 2, 'Treat each group as one block, arrange the blocks, then arrange books within each block.', 'Block order: 3!. Internal orders: 2!, 3!, 4!. Product = 1728. Option A results from using combinations, which ignore order. Option B results from allowing repetition when it is forbidden. Option C results from using an incomplete permutation product.'),
