        ('mth11b-06-mcq-0291', 6, 'Evaluate 8C3.', '512', '56', '6', '336', 'b', 1, 'Use nCr = n!/[r!(n−r)!].', 'C(8,3) = 8!/[3!(5)!] = 56. Option A results from using permutations, which count order. Option C results from using the wrong complementary or adjacent index. Option D results from an arithmetic slip after applying the combination identity.'),
