Option D: Option A has x², Option C has xy, and Option D has x³..'),
        ('mth11b-08-mcq-0143', 8, 'Which inequality is strict?', '2x + y ≤ 8', '4x − y ≥ 3', 'x + 5 > 9', '7x + 2 ≤ 11', 'c', 1, 'Strict inequalities use only < or >.', 'Correct working:
