        ('mth11b-08-mcq-0144', 8, 'Which inequality is slack?', 'x − 4 < 2', '2x + 3y > 9', '5x − y ≤ 6', '7x + 1 > 0', 'c', 1, 'Slack inequalities use ≤ or ≥.', 'Correct working:
