        ('mth11b-08-mcq-0145', 8, 'For 6x − 9 ≥ 0, which statement describes the solution set?', 'All real x less than 3/2', 'All real x greater than or equal to 3/2', 'Only x=3/2', 'No real x', 'b', 1, 'Isolate x by moving the constant and dividing by a positive number.', 'Correct working:
