        ('mth11b-08-mcq-0147', 8, 'Which number-line mark represents inclusion of an endpoint?', 'A hollow circle', 'A filled circle', 'A dotted vertical line', 'An arrow only', 'b', 1, 'Use the mark associated with ≤ or ≥.', 'Correct working:
