        ('mth11b-08-mcq-0148', 8, 'Which number-line representation is appropriate for x < 5?', 'Filled circle at 5 and shading right', 'Hollow circle at 5 and shading left', 'Filled circle at 5 and shading left', 'Hollow circle at 5 and shading right', 'b', 1, 'The endpoint is excluded and values smaller than 5 are required.', 'Correct working:
