        ('mth11b-08-mcq-0150', 8, 'For 4x − y > 8, how should the boundary be drawn?', 'Solid line because > includes equality', 'Dotted line because > excludes equality', 'A vertical line x=8', 'A horizontal line y=8', 'b', 1, 'Strict inequalities exclude the boundary.', 'Correct working:
The boundary is 4x−y=8 and is drawn dotted because the inequality is strict.
