        ('mth11b-08-mcq-0151', 8, 'What is a half plane?', 'A set of points on a single point', 'One of the two regions into which a line divides the Cartesian plane', 'Only the first quadrant', 'The boundary line itself', 'b', 1, 'Think about how a line partitions the plane.', 'Correct working:
A line divides the Cartesian plane into two regions, each called a half plane.
Therefore, the correct answer is One of the two regions into which a line divides the Cartesian plane.
