        ('mth11b-08-mcq-0152', 8, 'To identify the half plane represented by an inequality, which test is sufficient?', 'Choose any point on the boundary', 'Choose a point not on the boundary and test it', 'Use only the x-intercept', 'Use only the y-intercept', 'b', 1, 'The method uses a test point not lying on the boundary line.', 'Correct working:
