        ('mth11b-08-mcq-0153', 8, 'If an inequality is ax+by ≥ c, what is true of points on ax+by=c?', 'They are excluded', 'They are included', 'They are included only at the origin', 'They are included only in the first quadrant', 'b', 1, 'The symbol ≥ includes equality.', 'Correct working:
