        ('mth11b-08-mcq-0154', 8, 'What is the solution set of a system of two inequalities?', 'Points satisfying only the first inequality', 'Points satisfying only the second inequality', 'Points common to all inequalities', 'All points in the Cartesian plane', 'c', 1, 'A system requires every inequality to be true simultaneously.', 'Correct working:
