        ('mth11b-08-mcq-0155', 8, 'Which interval is unbounded?', '[−2, 5]', '(1, 4]', '[7, ∞)', '[0, 3]', 'c', 1, 'An interval extending indefinitely has an infinity endpoint.', 'Correct working:
