        ('mth11b-08-mcq-0156', 8, 'If a,b are real and ab>0, what can be concluded?', 'a and b have opposite signs', 'a and b have the same sign', 'a=0 or b=0', 'Both must be positive', 'b', 1, 'A positive product results when two nonzero real numbers have matching signs.', 'Correct working:
