        ('mth11b-08-mcq-0157', 8, 'If a/b<0 for real a,b with b≠0, what follows?', 'a and b have the same sign', 'a and b have opposite signs', 'a=b', 'a and b are both positive', 'b', 1, 'A negative quotient occurs when numerator and denominator have different signs.', 'Correct working:
