        ('mth11b-08-mcq-0158', 8, 'For a>0, which is equivalent to |x|<a?', 'x≤−a or x≥a', '−a<x<a', '−a≤x≤a', 'x<−a or x>a', 'b', 1, 'A strict absolute-value bound keeps x strictly between the two symmetric endpoints.', 'Correct working:
